      "text": "Noise-control policy\n\n1. EMA smooths one-sample spikes\n2. Challenger must exceed active score by threshold\n3. Challenger must stay ahead for ~3s\n4. Current camera stays for at least ~8s\n5. Recently removed camera enters cooldown\n6. Critical score or stream failure overrides stability",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Noise-control policy\n\n1. EMA smooths one-sample spikes\n2. Challenger must exceed active score by threshold\n3. Challenger must stay ahead for ~3s\n4. Current camera stays for at least ~8s\n5. Recently removed camera enters cooldown\n6. Critical score or stream failure overrides stability",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aN",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "57fae73e-597b-474e-8c91-8344e565e020",
      "type": "rectangle",
