      "text": "**** Performance boundaries\n• Motion values live outside React render state\n• Evaluate policy once per second\n• One decoder per visible tile\n• Preload standby stream before crossfade\n• Pause or reduce quality in hidden tabs",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** Performance boundaries\n• Motion values live outside React render state\n• Evaluate policy once per second\n• One decoder per visible tile\n• Preload standby stream before crossfade\n• Pause or reduce quality in hidden tabs",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "an",
      "autoResize": true
